                "text": "Seniors shouldn\u2019t be punished for working later in life. Unfortunately, Americans can face higher fees for delaying Medicare enrollment.\n\nI'm proud to reintroduce a bipartisan bill to cap these late fees and lower Medicare costs for seniors.\nhttps://t.co/E2IYIBtuP8",
