                "text": "It makes no sense for seniors to face fees for delaying Medicare enrollment. Unfortunately, this is the case for too many Americans who choose to work later in life.\n\nI'm leading a bipartisan bill to cap these unnecessary fees and lower costs for seniors.\nhttps://t.co/E2IYIBu2EG",
