                "text": "Washington should make life easier for Americans, not harder.\n\nThat's why I'm working to:\n\u2705 increase the SALT cap & extend middle-class tax cuts\n\u2705 expand ways to reward good financial behavior & help Americans grow their credit\n\u2705 cap late fees on Medicare enrollment\n\n& more.",
